{"type":"npc","name":"Wellwisher","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":133,"temp":0,"max":133,"details":""},"ac":{"value":28,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"swim","value":40}],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":13,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"slashing","value":3,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"bludgeoning","value":13,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]},{"type":"piercing","value":13,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey","thalassic"],"details":""},"level":{"value":9},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Wellwishers are an unusual composite creature who forms as the result of a ritual in which a trio of fey embodying fortune merge together into a single whole. Wellwishers require fresh water and the fortune of mortals for nourishment, which makes wells their most common habitat and leads to their name. However, sometimes they live in pristine woodland pools and other locations with legends for granting wishes. Though a wellwisher's blessings sometimes bring good luck, they are more likely to cause misfortune at a critical moment.</p><p>Wellwishers harbor a distinct obsession with the number three. Areas near their homes often demonstrate a bizarre number of threes, both subtle and impossibly obscure, from triangles and groups of three stones to waymarkers placed exactly three paces apart, measured from the average stride of the person who dug the well. An esoteric way to detect the presence of a wellwisher is to simply pour water from a well that they are suspected to dwell within onto a flat surface. Given a few minutes, the water will flow into a distinctly triangular shape.</p><h2>Wellwisher's Rhyme</h2><p>A simple communion with the wellwisher is all it takes for them to exert their power, made all too appealing by an old piece of folklore:</p><p><em>Three coins tossed, wishes cast,</em></p><p><em>Drink deep well's water, 'til thirst has passed.</em></p><p><em>Rest and dream of water's flow.</em></p><p><em>Your wishes granted, hopes bestowed.</em></p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 90/200/360 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics, Deception, Diplomacy, Nature, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, constitution, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (vitality), intelligence, mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision), spells (Primal: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Gb7SeieEvd0pL2Eh]{Sure Strike}), strength, sturdy, throwing, water, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Kalen Herrmann-Mowling","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":6}},"perception":{"details":"lucksense (imprecise) 330 feet","mod":18,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":20,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":20,"special":[]},"deception":{"base":20,"special":[]},"diplomacy":{"base":19,"special":[]},"nature":{"base":16,"special":[]},"stealth":{"base":16,"special":[{"label":"in water","predicate":["terrain:water"],"base":20}]}},"traits":{"value":["amphibious","fey","water"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"wVvrX49kTdaZPMSL","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/wellwisher.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Wellwisher","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/wellwisher.webp","