slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"ZVY4bd1qYhsEDifk","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-blade-scimitar-gray-red.webp","name":"Sure Strike","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The next time you make an attack roll before the end of your turn, roll it twice and use the better result. The attack ignores circumstance penalties to the attack roll and any flat check required due to the target being @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden}. You are then temporarily immune to <em>sure strike</em> for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spell-effects.Item.fpGDAz2v5PG0zUSl]{Spell Effect: Sure Strike}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"sure-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","fortune"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"until the end of your turn","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"ZVY4bd1qYhsEDifk","heightenedLevel":1,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.Gb7SeieEvd0pL2Eh","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"Kykmy5l6mzuUKofl"},{"type":"action","name":"Lucksense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A wellwisher senses the threads of fate that dance around creatures affected by fortune or misfortune effects.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"usPfEvRd91NlKypS","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Wish Twist","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature who previously made a wish in the well would attempt a check in pursuit of fulfilling their wish, or a creature who took damage from one of the wellwisher's Strikes in the last minute would attempt a check</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature must immediately attempt a @Check[flat|dc:13]. On a success, the creature rolls twice and takes the better result on the triggering check; on a failure, it rolls twice and take the worse result. After using Wish Twist on a creature, the wellwisher can't use Wish Twist on that creature again until that creature makes another wish or they hit the creature with another Strike.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fortune","misfortune","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"QowjwtIIq5Gi5RPo","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Trinary Luck","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The wellwisher rolls a 3 or 13 on a check</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The wellwisher can choose to resolve the check as if they had rolled a 20 instead. If they do, the next time they roll a 20 on a check against an opponent of at least level 5; they treat this 20 as if they had rolled a 3 instead. This mandatory conversion is not a fortune or misfortune effect and happens after all fortune or misfortune effects are applied. After turning a 3 or 13 into a 20, they can't do so again until after a 20 has been turned into a 3.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Note","title":"{item|name}","selector":["skill-check","attack","saving-throw","perception"],"text":"{item|description}","predicate":[{"or":["check:roll:total:natural:3","check:roll:total:natural:13"]}],"visibility":"owner"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fortune","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"f0C3KB5IS5rWYs4P","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Tail","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":n